; Eager instantiation is taken unasked once the lemma block it would
; conjoin is large enough to stand in for many refinement rounds. Sixteen
; distinct write indexes over one equality is sixteen lemmas, past the
; floor, and the query carries no read to expand -- so the policy's
; structural guard is not what decides it here.
